<div class="tokens-empty">
  <div class="nav">
    <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>">← Back to Transcript</a>
  </div>

  <h1>Token Dashboard — No Data</h1>

  <div class="no-data-message">
    <p>
      The token dashboard requires <code>events.db</code> to be populated
      by <code>EventStore</code>.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>To capture token data:</strong>
    </p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        Attach <code>EventStore</code> to your logger in the agent:
        <pre>store = EventStore.new()
store.attach(logger)
# Now run the agent; events will be written to .boukensha/events.db</pre>
      </li>
      <li>
        Refresh this page once the session completes.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p>
      <strong>To analyze existing week1 sessions:</strong>
    </p>

    <pre>python3 measure_baseline.py .boukensha/sessions/session.jsonl</pre>

    <p>
      This will populate <code>events.db</code> from the JSONL file,
      and you can then view this dashboard.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
